# Home page
### Get movies by genres
GET http://localhost:8000/api/movies?genres=adventure
### Get genres
GET http://localhost:8000/api/movie-genres

# Movie page
### Get movie info
GET http://localhost:8000/api/movies/3fe18877-4807-4a0e-b64a-396e58f3c6c7
